L1: Prevention of Teratogenesis in Pregnancies of Obese Rats by Vitamin E Supplementation
L2: Antioxidants (2021)
L3: Martin Alcala, Victoria E. Bolado, Isabel Sánchez-Vera, Sonia Clapés, Francisco Dasí, Guillermo Sáez, Esther Carrera, Fabiola Alvarez-Gallego, Mary R. Loeken, Marta Viana
